## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical understanding of NUMA-awareness, lock-free queues, and cross-socket traffic with priority cues. It probes ability to design data structures, pick atomics, and reason about fairness.

## Key Concepts
- NUMA-aware design and local queues
- Lock-free synchronization with C11 atomics and memory order
- Priority queuing and drain path to minimize cross-socket traffic
- Fairness and backpressure in multi-core environments

